    {
      "name": "burn",
      "docs": [
        "Burns every unit of `quote_mint` held by the coin's burner PDA in `burner_quote`. Permissionless. A zero",
        "balance is a no-op (succeeds, burns nothing), so a crank never fails on a quiet coin."
